# Component: Backend -> Deployment -> Docker build exclusions
# Belongs to: read by `docker build` for both backend/Dockerfile and Dockerfile.light.
# Purpose: keeps caches, virtualenvs, secrets (.env), and local uploads out of the built
# image — smaller, faster builds and no accidental secret baked into a layer.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
uploads/
*.log
